<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts matched the estimate of 100,000 head, USDA reported. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady to $0.50 per cwt lower than midsession Monday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    57.50 -58.00	   58.50 -59.00</p>
<p>few			57.00 -58.50	   58.00 -59.50</p>
<p>Sows:  uneven, generally steady to 2.00 higher</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00 -44.00	   42.50 -45.50</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   42.00 -47.00	   42.50 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -49.00	   46.00 -50.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
